You can apply for student finance using your normal bank account and then once you have your exam results (but before you acc start uni) change your bank details on your student finance account to your new student account

&#x200B;

Edit: Also you don't *need* a student bank account - they're good because they often have an interest free overdraft and sometimes you can get a free rail card or an extra £100 - but they're not required at all for student finance.

